  Lines:
  - SpeakerName: Shadow-Weaver Elder
    DialogueText: Sovereign, the main Crusader force is marching on the Sacred Tree
      at the heart of our swamp! If it falls, our magic dies with it.
    PortraitLeft: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitMiddle: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitRight: {fileID: 0}
    Background: {fileID: 0}
    Focus: 0
    BackgroundOverlay: 0
    EventID: 
    VoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - SpeakerName: Drakmora Commander
    DialogueText: They have brought siege weapons. This will be a massive assault.
    PortraitLeft: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitMiddle: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitRight: {fileID: 0}
    Background: {fileID: 0}
    Focus: 0
    BackgroundOverlay: 0
    EventID: 
    VoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - SpeakerName: Lilith
    DialogueText: Let them come. They will find only despair beneath its branches.
    PortraitLeft: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitMiddle: {fileID: 0}
